---
manual: element.para.multiple_args
lines: [3283, 3291]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  para "Among these films, which do you prefer?\n"
  radio; @film = para strong("The Taste of Tea"), " by Katsuhito Ishii\n"
end
----------- test code
film = para("@film")

assert_equal "The Taste of Tea by Katsuhito Ishii\n", film.text, "the arguments are joined in order"
assert_equal [Shoes::Strong, String], film.contents.map(&:class), "the fragment and the String both stay"
